<title>JAPAN: Japan June utility direct crude burning down 1.8%.</title>
<headline>Japan June utility direct crude burning down 1.8%.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japanese electric power utilities purchased a total of 1.21 million kilolitres of crude oil for direct burning in June, down 1.8 percent from a year earlier, the Trade Ministry said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Month-on-month, the June figure represented an increase of 35.6 percent.</p>
</text>
